@EirService.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:6004
@teacherToken = REPLACE_WITH_TEACHER_ACCESS_TOKEN
@sessionId = REPLACE_WITH_CREATED_SESSION_ID
@sessionCode = REPLACE_WITH_CREATED_SESSION_CODE
@requestId = REPLACE_WITH_CREATED_REQUEST_ID

### Anonymous monitoring
GET {{EirService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/monitoring/alive

### Create: title only; creator and time are taken from the server
POST {{EirService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/teachers/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Algorithms"}

### Teacher list
GET {{EirService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/teachers/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### Teacher detail
GET {{EirService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/teachers/sessions/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### Join: keep the student cookie between requests
POST {{EirService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/students/sessions/join
Content-Type: application/json

{"code":"{{sessionCode}}"}

### Student detail
GET {{EirService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/students/sessions/{{sessionId}}

### Student request: the server sets the ID and current generation
POST {{EirService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/students/sessions/{{sessionId}}/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"Please help","helpType":"Physical"}

### Student queue position
GET {{EirService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/students/sessions/{{sessionId}}/queue

### Teacher queue overview
GET {{EirService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/teachers/sessions/{{sessionId}}/queue
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### Teacher reservation
POST {{EirService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/teachers/sessions/{{sessionId}}/queue/take-next
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### Clear: a stale or repeated expectedGeneration returns 409
POST {{EirService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/teachers/sessions/{{sessionId}}/clear
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedGeneration":1}

### Current session requests: queuedAt ascending, then id; includes assignedTeacherId and assignedTeacherName
GET {{EirService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/students/requests?sessionId={{sessionId}}

### Student conversation: assignedTeacherName can be null when no name was supplied by the identity provider
# Completed statuses: CompletedByFaq (accepted FAQ), CompletedByDigital (teacher answer), CompletedByPhysical (physical help)
GET {{EirService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/students/requests/{{requestId}}
